$2(1-\frac{2}{|T|})\leq \sigma_{u,u}(t),\quad$ $\sigma_{u,v}(t)\leq \frac{4\sqrt{|T|-1}}{|T|},\quad$ $(1-\frac{2}{|T|})^2\leq \rho_{u,u}(t),\quad $ and $\quad \rho_{u,v}(t)\leq \frac{4(|T|-1)}{|T|^2}$ 
