Sedentariness then follows from Theorem~\ref{thm:sed} provided $n>\sqrt{1+4\gamma}+1$. If $\gamma=0$, it is evident from $E_0=\displaystyle\sum_{\mathbf{1}^\top \mathbf{y}=B^\top B\mathbf{y}=\mathbf{0}}\begin{bmatrix}
